# NOTE: public/sw.js is hand-written source, not a build artifact — it is
# intentionally tracked so the app works offline straight from a clone.
# The PWA icons under public/icons and app/*.png are produced by
# `npm run generate:icons` but are also tracked, because Next.js serves them
# as favicon/manifest assets without a build step.